        {
          "id": 669356740,
          "type": "DiffNote",
          "body": "I understand your concern, but I think when in the case IANA registered ports I would rather have it be the default and let people disable the dissector or use Decode As (or \"Try heuristic sub-dissectors first\"). I agree that there a number of other dissectors that probably should default to 0 because they use non-IANA registered ports by default.\n\nThe dissector already uses one of the two registered ports, it just doesn't dissect correctly, and I don't find that it's created a lot of problem.",
